    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1168" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Aegīdes</span></b> , ae, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>patr. m.</i>, =
